{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Enforce the limit on the final candidate**\n\nAfter operations and payloads are removed, the result is returned without another size check. A large execution error or retained identity field can therefore remain above the exporter\u2019s declared limit and be rejected or truncated downstream. Remeasure the final rendering, bound remaining optional fields such as error text, and explicitly skip/log when no legal record can fit. Cover oversized errors in both render shapes.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7sNF2_","finding_digest":"9516049f6847938afa61ef85f5a32cabcc5c4d5b3363450a60ed42321de98275","finding_id":"arf_v1_sulajh3ii6jyv6tb56c7lizmvp","finding_key":"insight-plugin/truncation.java::truncaterecord::final-size-bound","identity_key":"insight-plugin/truncation.java::truncaterecord::final-size-bound","line":89,"observation_digest":"9495f195c67b23f9303e40d238c20b8666979c690f9542394699093f85c5615b","observation_id":"aro_v1_ssk7dfogpmr7smb6idjdrqqlqz","path":"insight-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/insight/Truncation.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_sulajh3ii6jyv6tb56c7lizmvp","published_at":"2026-09-08T22:32:00Z","review_id":"arr_v1_2uiyk56mbx65mvlox4bqoub2i7","reviewed_base_sha":"a28d2262c18a8a1f1b7cc7296cf2bfd166e6ca94","reviewed_head_sha":"fe682327e1d3a6d0b6defad4684bab8d594438b5","reviewer":"codex","start_line":89,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":661},"record_id":"art_v1_tfklcljdto5o5dsm5wxk4vaw5j","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-08T22:32:00Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
